OL,3,AMet hands Grenfell fire investigation
OL,4,Afile to CPS
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has submitted
OL,7,Fits final investigation file into the
OL,8,FGrenfell Tower fire to the Crown
OL,9,FProsecution Service (CPS), seeking
OL,10,Fcharges against 54 individuals and 20
OL,11,Fcompanies.
OL,13,FThese include corporate manslaughter,
OL,14,Fgross negligence manslaughter, health
OL,15,Fand safety offences, fraud and
OL,16,Ffraud-related offences and misconduct
OL,17,Fin public office.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
