OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMet hands Grenfell fire investigation
OL,4,Afile to CPS
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met described the case into the
OL,7,Ffire which killed 72 people at the
OL,8,Ftower block in North Kensington, west
OL,9,FLondon, as one of the "most complex
OL,10,Finvestigations ever undertaken by any
OL,11,FUK law enforcement agency".
OL,13,FThe CPS said charging decisions would
OL,14,Fbe made before the 10th anniversary of
OL,15,Fthe disaster, which is on 14 June 2027.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
